# E3's two extra server-side binaries: the ThreadSanitizer build (make -C server
# tsan) and the load generator / smoke tester (make -C server loadtest). Built on
# demand, never deployed. The .dSYM is the debug bundle clang leaves beside a -g
# build on macOS.
server/gameserver-tsan
server/gameserver-tsan.dSYM/
server/loadtest
server/loadtest.dSYM/
